      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "In 1959, Art Anderson subdivided his 80‑acre homestead into quarter‑acre lots, selling many to workers at the nearby Clear Air Force Station.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
